{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19814","headline":"古别曲 · 孟郊","name":"古别曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山川古今路，纵横无断绝。\n来往天地间，人皆有离别。\n行衣未束带，中肠已先结。\n不用看镜中，自知生白发。\n欲陈去留意，声向言前咽。\n愁结填心胸，茫茫若爲说。\n荒郊烟莽苍，旷野风凄切。\n处处得相随，人那不如月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}